    { "dot": "amber", "title": "外部依赖", "items": ["海康 MVS SDK：MvCameraControl.Net.dll（x64）+ 相机原生运行时，appsettings.json 可覆盖路径", "推理栈：ONNX Runtime + OpenCvSharp（本仓库自带，不依赖 VisionMaster 服务）", "模型目录契约：PatchCore = model.onnx + memory_bank.bin；YOLO/Seg/SemanticSeg = best.onnx + classes.txt；轮廓匹配 = shape_template.json"] }
